question:
What does will-change do, and when should it be applied?
```css
.animated {
  will-change: transform;
  animation: spin 2s infinite;
}
```

Why is animating transform and opacity preferred over animating top/left?
```css
/* Fast: GPU accelerated */
@keyframes slide { from { transform: translateX(0); } to { transform: translateX(100px); } }

/* Slow: causes reflow */
@keyframes slide { from { left: 0; } to { left: 100px; } }
```

What is layout thrashing, and how does it harm performance?
```javascript
for (let i = 0; i < 100; i++) {
  element.style.width = element.offsetWidth + 10 + 'px'; /* reads then writes */
}
```

How do CSS containment rules (contain property) improve rendering?
```css
.card {
  contain: layout style paint;
}
```

Why might loading fonts asynchronously (font-display: swap) improve performance?
```css
@font-face {
  font-family: 'Custom';
  src: url('font.woff2');
  font-display: swap;
}
```

How does CSS minification and tree-shaking reduce bundle size?
```css
/* Before: 500 bytes */
.unused { color: red; }
.used { color: blue; }

/* After: 20 bytes */
.used{color:blue}
```
